{"section":{"id":"cet4-2025-12-set1-news-report-2","examId":"cet4-2025-12-set1","title":"新闻 2","kind":"新闻","start":144.75,"end":205.22,"preview":"In less than a month, the Special Olympics Spring Games will make a return to Fayetteville.","lines":[{"start":144.75,"end":151.06,"text":"In less than a month, the Special Olympics Spring Games will make a return to Fayetteville."},{"start":151.06,"end":155.06,"text":"The Games are coming back for the first time in five years."},{"start":155.06,"end":159.15,"text":"The event will take place at Methodist University."},{"start":159.15,"end":168.26,"text":"Event organizer Benjamin Kowalczyk says he's excited that athletes will get a chance to come back and demonstrate their abilities."},{"start":168.26,"end":173.7,"text":"Organizers expect about a hundred athletes will come out to compete in Fayetteville."},{"start":173.7,"end":179.87,"text":"They will have a variety of events to choose from, including running, throwing and jumping."},{"start":179.87,"end":183.22,"text":"There will also be a fun tent for children."},{"start":183.22,"end":189.22,"text":"Kowalczyk said it's rewarding to see athletes with special needs triumph in the games."},{"start":189.22,"end":194.03,"text":"For anyone who wants to help make this year's Games a massive success,"},{"start":194.03,"end":199.22,"text":"there are still opportunities to volunteer for Fayetteville's Special Olympics."},{"start":199.22,"end":205.22,"text":"Organisers encourage them to visit the Games website to sign up."}],"audio":"assets/audio/8f53d4096608b00b62f36491527adb187a754499ff483421b77b4532ba78f748.wav","audioOffset":144.75},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"In less than a month, the Special Olympics Spring Games will make a return to Fayetteville.","start":144.75,"end":151.06,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"时间","icon":"clock-3","image":"assets/images/7f4c863c95104a688285a43a465212040289a1d9000f5fc374e2295be60e336d.webp","alt":"运动员回到春